{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_19_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，正月，己卯，烝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"烝，冬事也。春興之，志不時也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"二、天王使家父來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，丁丑，烝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"烝，冬事也。春夏興之，黷祀也，志不敬也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"四、秋，伐邾。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月，雨雪。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"六、祭公來，遂逆王后於紀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_19_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_19","textTraditional":"其不言使焉何也？不正，其以宗廟之大事，即謀於我，故弗與使也。遂，繼事之辭也。其曰遂逆王后，故略之也。或曰天子無外，王命之則成矣。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}